      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "720b4937a0e672e6",
      "translationZh": "添加了 maxProseWidth 设置，用于限制 Claude 在宽终端中散文内容的宽度，而表格和代码块仍保持全宽",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "989bfe1b6ed7c8ed",
      "translationZh": "添加了启动通知，以及 /status 和 claude doctor 条目，用于列出项目设置文件中被忽略或关闭了遥测功能的遥测变量",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51f92dd0ba7ef395",
      "translationZh": "添加了 allowClaudeInChromeWithManagedMcp 管理设置，允许 claude --chrome 与专属的 managed-mcp.json 并行运行；现在当 Chrome 被拦截时显示的错误会指明该文件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "89192a2ddc4eb64f",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude 应用网关中添加了 store.readiness_grace_seconds，使 /readyz 能够在短暂的 Postgres 中断（例如数据库故障转移）期间保持就绪状态",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c8b788fd8f217e8f",
      "translationZh": "在全屏模式下的 /feedback 草稿列表中添加了滚动条；当鼠标悬停在列表上方时，滚动条会出现",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04ae3b1f37d58a63",
      "translationZh": "修复了在对话历史包含 API 无法解密的网络搜索结果（例如来自通过第三方网关回答的轮次）时，所有请求均以 400 错误失败的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e7b95aa7520cf9e",
      "translationZh": "修复了更多关于持续或恢复会话（--continue, --resume）以更改后的形式重新发送早期消息的情况，这可能会导致 API 丢弃 Claude 之前的推理过程",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c2d3cdb0948b5bb",
      "translationZh": "修复了当 Claude 正在工作时，如果使用 /model, /rename, /artifacts 或其他即时斜杠命令，会导致之前的扩展思维（extended thinking）被丢弃的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57c0728f1da5d1e9",
      "translationZh": "修复了在重新启动时使用遗漏了对话早期提供的内置工具的 --tools 列表时，固定的延续或恢复的对话会丢失早期的扩展思考的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a396613f61786f39",
      "translationZh": "修复了会话在每一轮都因 \"Invalid data in redacted_thinking block\" API 错误而失败的问题；Claude Code 现在会丢弃对话的思考块并重试一次",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9fd4ec1bc1070d7",
      "translationZh": "修复了当摘要请求被拒绝时压缩失败的问题；现在它会在备用模型上进行重试",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b0952b726dfe10f",
      "translationZh": "修复了在关闭思考且努力程度高于 high 的会话中，发生与安全相关的模型切换后，导致轮次失败（\"Effort 'xhigh' isn't available with thinking turned off\"）的问题",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1112bfe3fd11222",
